{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for It All</strong> is a survival Battle Royale blending modern military combat with sci-fi chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee combat with custom combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Co-op &amp; PvP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person &amp; third-person camera perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon system (10 ranged &amp; melee weapons)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Elements (Hunger, thirst &amp; stamina systems), Crafting, Looting,\u00a0Clothing &amp; armor with stat effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon attachments (scope, silencer, laser, flashlight)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished animations, sounds &amp; VFX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore &amp; dismemberment system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-realistic explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather (clear, rain, storms)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grounded Movement &amp; Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical but Fast Paced and realistic mechanics\u2014no over-the-top movement gimmicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A balance of modern firearms and sci-fi-inspired gadgets for strategic depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP and level up through a skill-based and XP-driven unlock system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons, perks, and character customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully ranked modes for every game type\u2014climb the leaderboards in competitive play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Regular Updates &amp; Community-Driven Evolution</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monthly updates with new content, balance changes, and improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A continuously evolving game shaped by player feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on competitive gameplay, rewarding progression, and tactical gunfights, <i>Battle for It All</i> delivers an FPS experience designed for both hardcore and casual players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the fight?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/789780?t=1766552945","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/789780?t=1766552945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766552945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766552945","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes Source SDK","id":16},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gun Violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for It All</strong> is a survival Battle Royale blending modern military combat with sci-fi chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee combat with custom combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Co-op &amp; PvP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person &amp; third-person camera perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon system (10 ranged &amp; melee weapons)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Elements (Hunger, thirst &amp; stamina systems), Crafting, Looting,\u00a0Clothing &amp; armor with stat effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon attachments (scope, silencer, laser, flashlight)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished animations, sounds &amp; VFX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore &amp; dismemberment system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-realistic explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather (clear, rain, storms)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grounded Movement &amp; Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical but Fast Paced and realistic mechanics\u2014no over-the-top movement gimmicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A balance of modern firearms and sci-fi-inspired gadgets for strategic depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP and level up through a skill-based and XP-driven unlock system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons, perks, and character customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully ranked modes for every game type\u2014climb the leaderboards in competitive play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Regular Updates &amp; Community-Driven Evolution</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monthly updates with new content, balance changes, and improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A continuously evolving game shaped by player feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on competitive gameplay, rewarding progression, and tactical gunfights, <i>Battle for It All</i> delivers an FPS experience designed for both hardcore and casual players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the fight?</p>","developers":["Matt Sowards Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789780/header.jpg?t=1766552945","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Battle For It All","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-Bit Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 760 or AMD 6700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Onboard Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-Bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 6700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 Ti or RX 480<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Matt Sowards Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa\r\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"14","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"true"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required